      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly heavy and suffocating to feel like you're living someone else's script. Recognizing this disconnect between your inner self and your outward life is a huge, brave first step. You have the right to define your own path, even if it feels daunting right now. Perhaps starting with small acts of self-expression—something just for you—could begin to reclaim a tiny bit of your space.",
